(ObjectType In ("DNS","Url","IP")) AND (EndpointOS = "linux" AND ((SrcProcImagePath endswithCIS "/python" OR SrcProcImagePath endswithCIS "/python3" OR SrcProcImagePath endswithCIS "/python2" OR SrcProcImagePath endswithCIS "/usr/bin/python" OR SrcProcImagePath endswithCIS "/usr/bin/python3" OR SrcProcImagePath endswithCIS "/usr/local/bin/python" OR SrcProcImagePath endswithCIS "/usr/local/bin/python3") AND (DstPort In Contains AnyCase (4372,443,8443))))
